--TEST--
a rename on a key in an attribute's payload rewrites the declared field and every key that names it, and not a key of another attribute with the same name, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
attribute Index on class { columns: string }
attribute Unique on class { columns: string }

#[Index(col<|>umns: "email")]
#[Unique(columns: "email")]
class Order {}
--REQUEST--
rename to=fields
--EXPECT--
case.nvs:2:28 fields
case.nvs:5:9 fields
